		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Massive, red-fleshed ogre with vast bat wings and a leonine lower half. Bargain- makers and gift-givers.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 14, <strong>HP</strong> 44, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 slam +7 (1d8) or 1 fireblast, <strong>MV</strong> near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +5, <strong>D</strong> +3, <strong>C</strong> +4, <strong>I</strong> +3, <strong>W</strong> +3, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 9</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Fireblast</strong>. 4d6 damage to all within a near-sized cube within far.</p><p></p><p><strong>Gift</strong>. Brand a willing target with the mark of Hell. Target gains one Tier 3 or lower priest spell. Freely observe via a branded creature's senses. Can inflict 6d6 damage on a branded creature at will.</p><p></p><p><strong>Impervious</strong>. Immune to elemental damage.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
